  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "63",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 63"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "63",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeniwu wudi nakufuma kuEdomi, nikuBozira, navwali mahina akuloomba wulombu wuchinana, hinyi? Yeniwu navwali yalubanŋa wudi nakunanuka naŋovu jindi jasweja hinyi? Yami, nahoshaŋa mwaloŋa, nasweja Ŋovu yakwamwina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indi yuma yeyi yakuvwala yinachinanidi? Mahineyi anelilidi neyi muntu wudi nakudatola muwukamwinu wavinyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nadatoli muwukamwinu wavinyu kanka wami, hikudi muntu wakunyuza yawantu inadiŋi ninduku. Eŋa, nayidati nakuzuwa kwami, nayidatoleli nakulendumuka kwami, mashi awu anasampokeli kumahinami, natamishŋuma yami yakuvwala yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa mumuchima wami mwadiŋiifuku dakutenda, nimwaka wawantu ami akúulewa wunashiki dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natalatalili, wakunkwasha kwosi. Nahayamini chikwabulili wakunkwatishaku. Dichi chikasa chamami aweni hichikunletela wamwinu. Kulendu mukakwami kwokwankwatishiluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadatili nyuza yawantu nakuzuwa kwami, nayishetesheli nakulendumuka kwami, namwaŋali mashi awu hamaseki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukutena mwelaŋayi Yehova mwaluwi, niyakushimeka Yehova, mwahita yuma yejima yanatutawiliyi Yehova, nikuwaha kwasweja kwanayiliyi akwamutaŋa waIsarela, kwanayitawiliyi mwahitahita wushona windi, mwahita yuma yaluwi yelayi yasweja kuvula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa yena welili nindi, Chalala hiyantu ami, anyana ákubula kwila mwakutwamba, dichi cheliliyi chamwinu chawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwejima mwakabiluwu wena, dimu mwakabiliyiyena nawa, kaŋelu wakumesu indi diyi wayamwinini. Wayikúulili nakukeŋa akwayikeŋeliyi nawushona wayitiyililiyi. Wayinya mwinaŋa, wayelekelaŋa amafuku akusharrkulu ejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, adikaŋili hiyakuneŋesha Spiritu yindi wajila. Dichi chabalumukililiyi hakwikala chilumbu chawu, hakulwa nawu yomweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwanuka nimafuku akunyaka niMosi niantu indi, nindi, Wayizambwili mukaluŋalwiji hamu nawatubiŋa twanyikoku yindi, wudi kudihi? Wáshili Spiritu yindi wajila mukachi kawu, wudi kudihi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahitishili chikasa ichindi champuhu kuchikasa chaMosi chachidiilu, wa ambwili meji kwakuyawukulonda aditiyakeshi ijina dahaya nyaka, wudi kudihi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayihitishili mumanyiŋa neyi kawalu wudi nakuhita mwisaŋa damukunkulwayi, mwaka abuli kudimbuka, wudi kudihi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Spiritu yaYehova wayinookesheli neyi yimuna yikukunkumuka muchinekineki, dimu walombweli antu eyi, kulonda wuditiyakeshi ijina dampuhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwiwulu muwudi, talaku chachiwahi munu mwishina, okukuwashakama, kwekala ni kujila kweyi nimpuhu yeyi, wumoni. Iyena deyidakumuchima, ninyidimu yeyi yaŋovu, yidi kudihi? Kusunkula kwakumuchima weyi kuwansunkulaŋa, niyuma yawushona yiwaŋalaŋa, wunayilekeshi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa yeyi tata yetu, hela Abarahama hatwilukaku, hela Isarela hatwitijaku, eyi Yehova, yeyi tata yetu, ijina deyi yeyi nkúuli yetu wakufumisha kunyaka yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova wunatuluwishilidi munjilajeyi, wuchinchikishi nyichima yetu tubulaŋa kukutiya woma? Funtaku wutoŋuhu ambuŋeyi, nyichidi yawuswana weyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu eyi ajila awuheteli kapinji kantesha hohu. Akwankunyi netu anadatoli dehi malaleyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunabalumuki dehi neyi antu iwabulili kuyula, neyi antu abula kutenenawu ijina deyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
